    "body": "How would you suggest I modify step 4?\r\n\r\nThe relationship to #732, as I understand it (but may indeed understand incorrectly) is that that PR was only necessary because DOMExceptions aren't proper Errors - but by making them proper Errors, then serialization of DOMExceptions should be automatic now?",
